Hello everyone, It's been a while!

Today we're eager to introduce you the new Update v1.4, bringing new essential changes. We do hope that it's the final pack of improvements the game gets before the Nintendo Switch announce comes along!

What's new in v.1.4:

 Three new battle scenes added: Southern Marshes, Deep Mire, Crystal Cave;
 New apparels for Charlie and Alister. They are available to buy from NPCs;
 The final optimisation's update: locations and battles load and perform even better than before;

Also added: 

 Detour obstacles system improved;
 Cut-scenes and dialogues fixes;
 Achievement "Didn't break a sweat" is now working on the normal difficulty.




Thank you for your support, 
Talerock team

